This repo publishes the central OPA / Rego policy pack consumed by every
Devotica Terraform module CI run via conftest. Policies enforce mandatory
tags (Foundation Plan §15.2), encryption requirements, no-public-S3,
no-IAM-wildcards, no-open-SG, and stateful-resource protection (PITR,
deletion guards) aligned with RBI / PCI-DSS / DPDP fintech controls.

Consumers pin against the floating @v1 tag (set via the conftest-policy-ref
input on terraform-shared-config's reusable workflow).

